<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of New York raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bank of New York raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gerard Klauer Mattison said analyst George Salem upgraded Bank of New York Co Inc to buy from hold after a bullish analysts meeting.</p>
<p>-- Salem has a target of $45 on the stock and raised his 1997 earnings estimate to $2.85 a share from $2.75.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 5/8 to 33-1/4.</p>
</text>
